      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Geo",
      "Anchor": "geo",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The Geo API returns the geo data for the given Geo ID. This API doesn\u2019t share member personal data as part of the API response.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Geo",
      "Anchor": "geo",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Geo represents geographic locations on LinkedIn (cities, regions, countries). Locations appear on organization profiles and in analytics demographic breakdowns.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Geo",
      "Anchor": "geo",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Note",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Geo",
      "Anchor": "geo",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "This API may also be referred to as \u0022Location\u0022 or \u0022Geography\u0022 in other contexts. This API does not support GET_ALL.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Geo",
      "Anchor": "geo",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The service provides the following methods:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Geo",
      "Anchor": "geo",
